    "body": "@cure53, I assume you're talking about URL validation?\r\n\r\nIf you're talking about the list of allowed tags, their attributes, and their values... what's considered safe/allowed varies; e.g. I cannot allow any inline styles (52pt red text would go against brand guidelines), but I might allow some known-safe class values (my light grey text being incorrectly used on a white background would cause accessibility issues), and in some locations I might allow `<a target=\"_blank\">` (keeping in mind the `noopener` issue).",
